          "text": "Hi [CLIENT_NAME_001], I reviewed Chapter 6 together with your image tracker and documented my recommendations in the attached file. It explains which items should be repositioned and which should be removed or replaced, including a licensing concern you should be aware of. I also identified where new visuals could contribute the most authority and included a note about captions.\nI’m happy to discuss any part of it with you, or, if you’d like to proceed, I can begin working directly on the full manuscript.",
