          "speaker": "client",
          "text": "Hi [FREELANCER_NAME_001],\n\nI’d like to proceed with the visual strategy pass for $600 total. To keep the process organized, I’d like to divide the work into three $200 milestones.\n\nFor every milestone, I’ll provide the relevant chapter files, the image tracker, and all visuals that are available.\n\nEach milestone should include these deliverables:\n\n1\\. Visual placeholders added within the manuscript chapters\n2\\. The image tracker updated for the applicable chapters\n3\\. A high-level explanation of the visual placement strategy for every chapter, so I can understand the rationale for what should be retained, removed, repositioned, added, sourced, or created\n\nThe objective is to determine:\n\nwhich visuals belong\nwhich visuals should be cut\nwhere each visual should be placed\nwhat must be sourced\nwhat requires permission\nwhat should be created at a later stage\n\nThe scope is limited to visual strategy and placement — it does not include final design, formatting, sourcing images, or creating graphics.\n\nMilestone 1 — $200\nChapters 1–3\n\nMilestone 2 — $200\nChapters 4–6\n\nMilestone 3 — $200\nChapters 7–10\n\nPlease let me know whether this arrangement works for you.\n\nThanks,\n[CLIENT_NAME_001]",
